  "title": "Authentic Polish Pickle Soup (Zupa Orgorkowa)",
  "description": "This authentic Polish pickle soup (zupa orgórkowa) recipe is a typical chicken and vegetable soup. It gets it's zing from sliced pickles and sour cream.",
  "authors": [
    "baginska"
  ],
